{"chars": "They climbed into the sleigh, and Santa gave the reins a gentle shake. Dasher, Dancer, Vixen and Comet tossed their antlers and leaped, and up they rose, jingle, jingle, over the spruce tops and the blueberry bushes and the little clearing where a tiny guardian stood waving. Then the northern lights folded around them once more, green and violet and pink, and carried them away toward the next orchid, half a world away, where the mountains are so high that they touch the clouds.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.738, 0.738, 0.738, 0.738, 0.738, 0.938, 0.938, 0.938, 0.938, 1.038, 1.038, 1.038, 1.038, 1.038, 1.038, 1.038, 1.65, 1.775, 1.775, 1.775, 1.775, 1.9, 1.9, 1.9, 1.9, 1.9, 1.9, 2.225, 2.225, 2.225, 2.225, 2.225, 2.413, 2.413, 2.413, 2.413, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.862, 2.862, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 3.375, 3.375, 3.375, 3.375, 3.375, 3.375, 4.15, 4.263, 4.263, 4.263, 4.263, 4.263, 4.263, 4.263, 4.675, 4.75, 4.75, 4.75, 4.75, 4.75, 4.75, 4.75, 5.225, 5.3, 5.3, 5.3, 5.3, 5.3, 5.3, 5.638, 5.638, 5.638, 5.638, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.088, 6.362, 6.362, 6.362, 6.362, 6.362, 6.362, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.975, 6.975, 6.975, 6.975, 7.1, 7.1, 7.1, 7.1, 7.1, 7.1, 7.1, 7.725, 7.825, 7.825, 7.825, 7.825, 7.938, 7.938, 7.938, 8.075, 8.075, 8.075, 8.075, 8.075, 8.225, 8.225, 8.225, 8.225, 8.225, 8.625, 8.675, 8.675, 8.675, 8.675, 8.675, 8.675, 8.675, 9.0, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.6, 9.675, 9.675, 9.675, 9.675, 9.675, 9.863, 9.863, 9.863, 9.863, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 10.3, 10.3, 10.3, 10.3, 10.3, 10.613, 10.613, 10.613, 10.613, 10.713, 10.713, 10.713, 10.713, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.225, 11.938, 11.938, 11.938, 11.938, 12.062, 12.062, 12.062, 12.062, 12.137, 12.137, 12.137, 12.137, 12.1